# Single-page app fallback.
#
# Without this, every deep link (/admin, /admin/login, /admin/products/new)
# returns Netlify's 404 page on a hard refresh or when opened directly, because
# those paths do not exist as files on disk. React Router owns them instead, so
# index.html is served and the router resolves the URL.
#
# The 200 status keeps it a rewrite rather than a redirect, so the browser keeps
# the requested URL in the address bar.
/*    /index.html   200
